OL,3,AFestival headlined by Andrea Bocelli
OL,4,Ascraps chorister fee after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrganisers of the Land of Song Festival
OL,7,Fhave announced they are scrapping a
OL,8,Fcontroversial #42 charge per choir
OL,9,Fmember.
OL,11,FThe "cheeky" fee prompted some choirs
OL,12,Fto pull out of the event after
OL,13,Frealising they would be charged
OL,14,Fthousands of pounds to take part.
OL,16,FIn a social media post, it was
OL,17,Fconfirmed the fee had been scrapped,
OL,18,Fand those entering were only required
OL,19,Fto pay the flat fee of #150 per choir.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
