OL,3,AFestival headlined by Andrea Bocelli
OL,4,Ascraps chorister fee after backlash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two-day festival is set to take
OL,7,Fplace in May 2027, with Italian tenor
OL,8,FAndrea Bocelli featuring on the
OL,9,FSaturday, marking the first time he has
OL,10,Fplayed in Wales for 22 years.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
